{"articleNo":"309443","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=309443&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[대학원] 2021 Fall Semester Graduate School Admission Guideline for International Students","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2021.05.18","hit":"7463","attachments":[{"name":"2021 Fall Semester Graduate School Admission Guideline(Korean).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=309443&attachNo=100261"},{"name":"2021 Fall Semester Graduate School Admission Guideline(English).pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=309443&attachNo=100262"},{"name":"[Form 1] Application Form for Fall Semester 2021.doc","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=309443&attachNo=100263"},{"name":"[Form 2] Self Introduction_자기소개서.doc","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=309443&attachNo=100264"},{"name":"[Form 3] Study Plan_수학계획서.doc","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=309443&attachNo=100265"},{"name":"[Form 4] Recommendation Letter_출신대학교 교수 추천서.doc","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=309443&attachNo=100266"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem;\">We are pleased to inform you of 2021 KIT Fall Semester Graduate School Admission Guideline for International student.&nbsp;</span><br></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem;\"><br></span></div><div><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">Please see attached for further information and if there are any candidates </span>interested<span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">&nbsp;in this program, please ①<span style=\"background-color: rgb(250, 237, 125);\">fill out online application through school webpage</span> and ②<span style=\"background-color: rgb(250, 237, 125);\">send me one original application document through post</span> and ③<span style=\"background-color: rgb(250, 237, 125);\">one scanned application document(except the letter of recommendation) through E-mail</span> no later than June 15th, 2021.&nbsp;</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">All required documents must be written either in English or Korean by computer typing.&nbsp;</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">For further information, please see attached or visit school website.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">(www.kumoh.ac.kr</span><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">,&nbsp; http://eng.kumoh.ac.kr)&nbsp;</span></div><div><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">1. Submission Deadline</span>: June 15th, 2021(Overdue application will be rejected)&nbsp;</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">2. Submission address</span></font></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 1rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><u>1) Online application</u>:&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://etx.kumoh.ac.kr/html/gtx/2021/web/w_gtx_graduate_frnr_jupsu.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tx-link\">https://etx.kumoh.ac.kr/html/gtx/2021/web/w_gtx_graduate_frnr_jupsu.html</a></font><br></div><div><i><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">(However, Access will be <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 85, 255);\">restricted from 19:00 to 24:00 on May 31st </span>due to the network security device updates)&nbsp;</span></i></div><div><br></div><div><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"><u>2) Original application document submission:</u></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">61 Daehak-ro, Gumi, Gyeongbuk, Korea,</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">Kumoh National Institute of Technology</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">International Education Building, E103 (Postal Code 39177)</span></font></div><div><font color=\"#212121\" face=\"Noto Sans KR, Nanum Gothic, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-siz